  "name": "cgmath-rs",
  "description": "A specialized linear algebra and mathematics library for computer graphics, providing strongly-typed primitives for 2D and 3D geometric operations. It implements column-major matrices, quaternions, affine transformations, and perspective projections, alongside spatial primitives like AABBs, frustums, and collision spheres. The library prioritizes type safety and fixed-dimension performance over general-purpose n-dimensional flexibility.",
